The options and the date semantics (years at the next anniversary, current
years, count up, one-time dates, half anniversary, dates without a year) follow
the Home Assistant Anniversaries integration by pinkywafer
(https://github.com/pinkywafer/Anniversaries, MIT License). No file of it is
included: the calendar code of this integration is a new JavaScript
implementation.
